(Nimbus Labs Information Security Policy) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
(Version 4.1 - effective 1 July 2026. Owner: Security Team \(security@nimbuslabs.example\).) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
8 TL
() Tj
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(1. Passwords and Authentication) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
(All accounts must use passwords of at least 14 characters. Password managers are) Tj
T*
(mandatory; the company provides 1Password to every employee. Multi-factor authentication) Tj
T*
(\(MFA\) is required for email, source control, cloud consoles and the VPN. Hardware) Tj
T*
(security keys are required for administrators.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
8 TL
() Tj
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(2. API Keys and Secrets) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
(API keys and access tokens must be rotated at least every 90 days. Secrets must never be) Tj
T*
(committed to source control; they are stored in the company vault. A leaked secret must) Tj
T*
(be revoked immediately.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
8 TL
() Tj
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(3. Devices) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
(Company laptops must use full-disk encryption and lock automatically after 5 minutes of) Tj
T*
(inactivity. Operating system security updates must be installed within 7 days of) Tj
T*
(release.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
