stream
BT
50 790 Td
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(4. Incident Reporting) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
(Any suspected security incident, such as a phishing email, a lost laptop or a leaked) Tj
T*
(password, must be reported to the Security Team within 1 hour of discovery, by email to) Tj
T*
(security@nimbuslabs.example or in the #security-incidents Slack channel.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
8 TL
() Tj
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(5. Data Classification) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
(Company data is classified into four levels: Public, Internal, Confidential and) Tj
T*
(Restricted. Customer data is always classified as Restricted. Restricted data may only) Tj
T*
(be stored in approved systems and must be encrypted at rest and in transit.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
8 TL
() Tj
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(6. Access Reviews) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
(Managers review the access rights of their team members every quarter. Access for) Tj
T*
(employees who leave the company is removed on their last working day.) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
8 TL
() Tj
T*
/F2 13 Tf
18 TL
(7. Security Training) Tj
T*
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
(All employees complete security awareness training during onboarding and then once per) Tj
T*
(year. Phishing simulations are run every quarter.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
